{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167","id":5734557718,"node_id":"I_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABVc5oFg","number":167,"title":"aecp_notify: a command's probe cancel is lost when a TIME_LIMITED drain cancels in the same cycle (count 1)","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-06T19:55:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T04:52:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"[A10] Found by processor #69 lane round 2 (A550, PR #165 HANDOFF Notes). It predates #69 and is not changed by it.\n\nAt one AVB interface, `KL_aecp_notify` can lose a command's availability-probe cancel. A TIME_LIMITED drain's cancel and a command's cancel can fall in the same cycle; the single cancel path sends the drain's and drops the command's. The superseded exchange then stays in the originator's in-flight table, and its later failure can remove a live controller's registry row.\n\nAt two interfaces, #69 round 2 sends both (cancel-pending bits, drained one per cycle; check CA1b).\n\n**Acceptance:**\n1. At count 1, both cancels are sent: reuse #69's cancel-pending drain, or prove the command's cancel cannot coincide with a drain.\n2. A pp_top / aecp_notify check of the same-cycle case, with a planted control that drops the second cancel.\n3. OOC 1x1 delta within 20 LUT / 20 FF. Every arm still plants.\n\nRelates to #69.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/167/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}